WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.985
Under Sermons, you'll find the latest messages from Paramount Church.

00:00:04.985 --> 00:00:08.478
Browse the newest ones, or look through each series.

00:00:09.281 --> 00:00:12.147
Tap any sermon to listen right here in the app.

00:00:12.147 --> 00:00:17.878
You can skip back, jump ahead, or change the speed, and it keeps playing while you take notes.

00:00:18.679 --> 00:00:25.058
Tap Take notes, and your sermon notes begin with the title, the date, and the speaker already filled in.

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:28.491
Your notes follow the church's template.

00:00:28.491 --> 00:00:37.635
Tap the dot beside a section to change its color, use the menu to move or remove a section, and add more points or questions at the bottom.

00:00:38.435 --> 00:00:45.480
Everything you write is saved on your phone, and when you sign in, it stays in sync across your devices.

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:49.274
You can watch these videos again any time from Settings.

00:00:49.274 --> 00:00:51.171
Enjoy your time in the Word.
